/* GWYLAN */
:: WLI Gwylan Brand Intro
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<set $gwylanSeen.pushUnique("wraith_brand")>>
<<wliBrandFocus>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"C-Can I show you something?" you ask, before you can talk yourself out of it. "I don't know who else to ask."
	<<case "polite" "docile">>
		"You know about symbols," you say carefully. "Could I show you one? I'd rather not carry it alone."
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"Darling," you say, "you're the only person I know who reads skin for a living. Indulge me."
	<<case "bratty" "cruel">>
		"You've got your markings," you say. "Well. Someone gave me one without asking."
	<<case "confident">>
		"You said your tattoos mean something," you say. "So does this one. I want to know what."
	<<default>>
		"I want to show you something," you say. "And I want you to tell me the truth about it."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
You bare your <<bodypart _brandPart>>.
<br><br>
Gwylan leans closer to examine the mark, and <<his>> expression turns serious. <<He>> places <<his>>
palm a few centimetres above your skin without touching it, checking whether the mark is giving off any heat.
<br><br>
"Oh, <<pcpetname "Gwylan" "simple">>," <<he>> says quietly. "How long have you had this?"
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Gwylan Brand Advice]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Gwylan Brand Advice
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<wliBrandFocus>>
You tell <<him>>. The lake, the pale figure, the cold. It comes out badly and in the wrong order,
and <<he>> doesn't interrupt once.
<br><br>
When you finish, Gwylan leans back. "<<if _brandWeight gte 4>>Those marks aren't exactly curses.<<else>>That mark isn't exactly a curse.<</if>>
They're more like claims." <<He>> touches the knot-shaped mark on <<his>> stomach.
"Mine shows a debt I still have to repay. Yours is different.
Whatever made it seems to think it has some kind of right over you."
<br><br>
<<if _brandWeight gte 4>>
	"There are already several marks," <<he>> says, <<his>> brow furrowing. <span class="red">"Whatever is doing this is trying to keep a hold on you."</span>
<<else>>
	"There's only one mark so far," <<he>> says. <span class="red">"But I don't think it'll stay that way."</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Gwylan Brand Advice 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Gwylan Brand Advice 2
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<wliBrandFocus>>
"I'll tell you what I can, and you won't like it... <i>I can't lift this</i>. Nobody in this town can.
What's on your <<bodypart _brandPart>> was put there by something that predates the temple and the shop and me."
<<He>> exhales. "What I can do is make sure it isn't a secret you're keeping by yourself.
Secrets are how these things get room to grow."
<br><br>
<<if $gwylanTalked.includes("stone_pendant") or $worn.neck.name is "stone pendant">>
	"Keep the pendant on you," <<he>> adds. "It won't cut the tie. It might make you harder to find."
	<br><br>
<</if>>
"Anything that isn't human is going to be able to read that on you now, the way I just did.
Some will keep their distance." <<His>> mouth flattens. "Some will take it as a challenge."
<br><br>
<<link [[Ask what happens if it comes for you|WLI Gwylan Brand Comfort]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Say nothing|WLI Gwylan Brand Comfort]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Gwylan Brand Comfort
<<if $phase is 1>>
    "What happens if it comes for me?" you ask. Your throat feels dry as you wait for <<his>> answer.
    <br><br>
    "Then you come here," Gwylan says, without a single second of hesitation. "Whatever hour it is. You come here."
<<else>>
    You try to speak, but no sound comes out. You open your mouth again, but you still cannot say anything.
    <br><br>
    Gwylan waits, but when you still cannot answer, <<he>> lets the silence continue.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> steps closer and opens <<his>> arms, waiting for you to come to <<him>> if you want to.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Gwylan Brand Comfort 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Gwylan Brand Comfort 2
<<effects>><<run statusCheck("Gwylan")>>
<<wliBrandFocus>>
<<wliRngBoost 2>>
You step closer to Gwylan, and before you can say anything, you start crying.
<br><br>
At first you try to hold it back, but your breathing quickly breaks into sobs.
You cover your face and struggle to calm yourself, though the tears keep coming.
Gwylan stays with you without asking questions or telling you to stop.
<br><br>
<<He>> places one hand between your shoulders and slowly strokes your hair with the other.
You lean against <<him>> and let yourself cry until your breathing begins to settle.
The pain from the brand is still there, but talking to someone who believes you makes it easier to bear.
<br><br>
Gwylan stays with you until some of the fear and stress caused by the brand begins to ease.
<<set _relief to Math.clamp(10 + _brandWeight * 3 + _wliRngBonus, 10, 40)>>
<<trauma `-_relief`>><<stress `-(_relief * 2)`>><<llltrauma>><<lllstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Gwylan Brand Comfort 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Gwylan Brand Comfort 3
<<effects>>
Gwylan keeps <<his>> arm around you.
<br><br>
"You're not property," <<he>> says.
"I don't care what they put on your skin. Nobody gets to own you."<<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><<glove>>
<br><br>
<<gwylanOptions>>

/* TEMPLE */
:: WLI Temple Confess Brand
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<rngWraith>>
<<wliBrandFocus>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"S-Something wrote on me," you say. "While I was asleep, I think. It won't come off."
	<<case "polite" "docile">>
		"I don't know if this counts as a sin," you say. "Something marked me. I didn't agree to it."
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"I've been claimed," you announce to the wooden slats. "Rather rudely, and without paperwork."
	<<case "bratty" "cruel">>
		"Something decided I belong to it," you say. "It wrote that down. On me."
	<<case "confident">>
		"Something put its name on my skin," you say. "I want to know what your lot make of that."
	<<default>>
		"Something marked me," you say. "I want someone to look at it and tell me what it is."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
The incense keeps burning behind the screen, but the person on the other side stays completely still.
<br><br>
"Describe it," the <<personssimple>> says. <<His>> voice sounds different now,
with none of the strange accent <<he>> was using before.
<br><br>
You realise the strange voice was an act, and <<he>> has stopped using it.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Temple Confess Brand 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Temple Confess Brand 2
<<effects>><<wliBrandFocus>>
You describe the <<tattoo _brandPart>> on your <<bodypart _brandPart>><<if _brandWeight gte 4>>,
then tell <<him>> about the others<</if>>. Before you finish, the small metal panel between
the booths slides open and you hear <<him>> get to <<his>> feet.
<br><br>
<<if $attendant is "Confessor">>
	"Stay where you are," <<he>> says. "I'm staying here too."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|WLI Temple Confess Brand Confessor]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	"Don't move. Stay in the booth."
	<br><br>
	You hear <<him>> open the door on <<his>> side and leave. You remain seated while the smell of incense hangs around you,
	listening to your own breathing as you wait.
	<br><br>
	After some time, the door on the other side opens. Someone enters and sits behind the screen.
	<br><br>
	<span class="purple">Another confessor has come to speak with you.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|WLI Temple Confess Brand Confessor]]>><<endevent>><<generateConfessor 1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "Confessor">><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: WLI Temple Confess Brand Confessor
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<wliBrandFocus>>
<<wliRngBoost 2>>
<<set $wli.templeTold to true>>
"Show me."
<br><br>
You hold your <<bodypart _brandPart>> near the open shutter. <<He>> reaches through, takes your arm,
and turns it towards the light so <<he>> can see the mark clearly.
<<He>> studies it without pulling away or looking shocked. Seeing how calmly <<he>> examines it makes you uneasy.
<br><br>
<<if _brandWeight gte 4>>
	"There is more than one," <<he>> says after looking closer. "And they have been appearing again."
<<else>>
	"Only one," <<he>> says. "For now."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"This is no sin of yours, child. You did not put this mark on yourself." <<He>> releases your arm.
"Some marked you as theirs. The mark was made with something very old, and whoever did it wanted the meaning to be clear."
<br><br>
<span class="purple">You feel the shame come off you</span>.
<<set _relief to Math.clamp(8 + _brandWeight * 2 + _wliRngBonus, 8, 30)>>
<<trauma `-_relief`>><<stress `-(_relief * 2)`>><<lltrauma>><<lllstress>>
/* Grace is a temple-rank stat; granting it to someone who never joined is invisible. */
<<if $temple_rank and $temple_rank isnot "prospective">><<grace 5 "monk">><<ggrace "monk">><</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Temple Confess Brand Confessor 2]]>><</link>>

:: WLI Temple Confess Brand Confessor 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<wliBrandFocus>>
<<set _templeMember to ($temple_rank and $temple_rank isnot "prospective")>>
<<if _templeMember>>
	/* Already one of them. Inviting <<him>> to "come inside and take the vows" would be nonsense. */
	"You won't be safe outside now," <<he>> says. "Stay under this roof. No errands past the gate,
	no sleeping anywhere we can't reach you."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> pauses before continuing.
	<br><br>
	"You'll be watched more closely than you're used to, and by people who have known you a while.
	That is the price of being looked after. I won't lie about that."
	<br><br>
	"You already carry our mark as well as the other one's," <<he>> says. "Sooner or later,
	you'll have to decide which one you intend to follow."
<<else>>
	"You won't be safe outside now," <<he>> says. "Come inside the temple. Take the vows, stay behind these walls,
	and let us protect you."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> pauses before continuing.
	<br><br>
	"You'll be fed, given somewhere safe to sleep, and protected from what is hunting you.
	But people here will watch you closely. I won't lie about that."
	<br><br>
	<<if $player.virginity.penile is true and $player.virginity.vaginal is true>>
		"You can still join through the usual ceremony. Speak to
		<<if C.npc.Jordan.init is 1>>Jordan<<else>>the initiate at the entrance<</if>> when you're ready."
		<br><br>
		<span class="green">You can still join the temple normally.</span>
	<<else>>
		"You can't enter through the usual ceremony any more," <<he>> says. "But there are other ways to become one of us."
		<br><br>
		<span class="red">The way <<he>> says it makes you decide not to ask what those ways are.</span>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if _templeMember>>
	<<link [[Agree to stay close|Temple Confess Self End]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse to be kept|WLI Temple Confess Brand Refuse]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Say you'll think about it|Temple Confess Self End]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|WLI Temple Confess Brand Refuse]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: WLI Temple Confess Brand Refuse
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>
<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		"I'd rather not," you manage. "S-Sorry."
	<<case "polite" "docile">>
		"Thank you," you say. "But no. I'll take my chances outside."
	<<case "flamboyant">>
		"How generous," you say. "And how firmly declined."
	<<case "bratty" "cruel">>
		"One owner's plenty," you say. "I'm not collecting."
	<<case "confident">>
		<<if $phase is 1>>
			"No," you say. "I already answer to you. That doesn't make me yours to shut in."
		<<else>>
			"No," you say. "I didn't come here to change hands."
		<</if>>
	<<default>>
		"No," you say. "I'll keep myself, thank you."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
The confessor says nothing for a while. <<He>> does not sound angry when <<he>> finally answers,
which somehow makes the silence more uncomfortable.
<br><br>
"As you like," <<he>> says. The shutter closes between you. "You know where the door is. It doesn't lock from your side."
<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Leave|Temple]]>><<endconfessionself>><</link>>
<br>
